hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2409","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna, tum mein se har fard aik tarah ka Hakim hai aur uski raiyat (zimmedaarii) ke barey mein us se sawal hoga. to badshah Hakim hi hai aur uski raiyat ke barey mein us se sawal hoga. har insan apne ghar ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. aurat apne shauhar ke ghar ki Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. khaadim apne aaqa ke maal ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat (zimmedaarii) ke barey mein sawal hoga. unhon-ne bayan kya ke ye sab maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha aur main samajhta hun ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya tha ke mard apne walid ke maal ka Hakim hai aur us se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga. to har shakhs Hakim hai aur har shakhs se uski raiyat ke barey mein sawal hoga."
"2410","maine aik shakhs ko Quran ki aayat is tarah padhtey suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maine iske khilaf suna tha. isliye main unka hath thaamey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ley gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (meraa aetraz sun kar) farmaya ke tum donon durust ho. Shoba ne bayan kya ke main samajhta hun ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke ikhtilaf na karo, kyonke tum se pahley log ikhtilaf hi ki wjah se tabah ho gaey."
"2411","2 logon ne jin mein aik musalman tha aur doosra yahoodii, aik doosrey ko bura-bhala kaha, musalman ne kaha, us zaat ki qasam! jisne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tamam duniya walon par buzurgi di aur Yahudi ne kaha, us zaat ki qism jisne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko tamam duniya walon par buzurgi di. is par musalman ne hath utha kar Yahudi ke tamaancha maaraa. wo Yahudi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur musalman ke sath apne waqia ko bayan kya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us musalman ko bulaya aur us se waaqie ke mutaalliq poochha. unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski tafseel bata di. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske baad farmaya, mujhey Musa (Alaihissalam) par tarjeeh na do. log qiyamat ke din behosh kar diye jaengey. main bhi behosh ho jaaunga. be-hoshi se hosh mein aaney wala sabse pahlaa shakhs main hoonga, lekin Musa (Alaihissalam) ko arshe-Ilaahii ka kinara pakdey huey paaunga. ab mujhey malum nahi ke Musa (Alaihissalam) bhi behosh honey walon mein hongey aur mujh se pahley unhein hosh aa jaeyga ya Allah Taala ne unko un logon mein rakha hai jo behoshii se mustashnaa hain."
"2412","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif farma they ke aik Yahudi aaya aur kaha ke aey abul-Qaasim! aap ke ashaab mein se aik ne mujhey tamaancha maara hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kis ne? usne kaha ke aik Ansari ne. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein bulaao. wo aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya tum ne usey maara hai? unhon-ne kaha ke maine usey bazar mein ye qism khaatey suna. us zaat ki qasam! jisne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko tamam insanon par buzurgi di. maine kaha, O, khabees! kya Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par bhi! mujhey ghussa aaya aur maine iske munh par thappad de maaraa. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya dekho anbiya mein aapasii aik doosrey par is tarah buzurgi na diya karo. log qiyamat mein behosh ho jaengey. apni qabr se sabse pahley nikalney wala main hi hoonga. lekin main dekhoonga ke Musa (Alaihissalam) arshe-Ilaahii ka paaya pakdey huey hain. ab mujhey malum nahi ke Musa (Alaihissalam) bhi behosh hongey aur mujh se pahley hosh mein aa jaeinge ya unhein pehli be-hoshii jo taur par ho chuki hai wahi kafi hogi."
"2413","aik Yahudi ne aik ladki ka sar 2 pattharon ke darmyan rakh kar kuchal diya tha. (is mein kuchh jaan baqi thi) us se puchha gaya ke terey sath ye kis ne kya hai? kya falan ne, falan ne? jab us Yahudi ka naam aaya to usne apne sar se ishara kya (ke haan) Yahudi pakda gaya aur usne bhi jurm ka iqrar kar liya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya aur uska sar bhi 2 pattharon ke darmyan rakh kar kuchal diya gaya."
"2414","aik sahabi koi cheez khareedtey waqt dhokaa kha jaya kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke jab to khareedaa karey to ye keh de ke koi dhokaa na ho. to wo isi tarah kaha kartey they."
"2415","aik shakhs ne apna aik ghulam aazad kya, lekin uske paas iske siwa aur koi maal na tha. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey iska ghulam wapas kara diya aur usey Naeem-bin-Nahaam ne khareed liya."
"2416","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jisne koi jhooti qism jaan-boojh kar khaaii taake kisi musalman ka maal naajaaiz taur par hasil kar ley. to wo Allah Taala ke samney us haalat mein hazir hoga ke Allah paak is par bahut hi ghazabnaak hoga. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! mujh se hi mutaalliq aik masley mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. mere aur aik Yahudi ke darmyan aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. us ne inkar kya to maine muqaddima Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya, kya tumharey paas koi gawah hai? maine kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ke phir to qism khaa. Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye jhooti qism kha lega aur mera maal uda ley jaeyga is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( '' beshak wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon se thodi poonchii khareedtey hain.'' aakhir aayat tak."
"2508","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zirah jau ke badley girwii rakhi thi. aik din main khud aap ke paas jau ki roti aur baasii charbi lekar hazir hua tha. maine khud Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke aal Muhammad par koi subah aur koi Sham aisi nahi aai ke aik saa se zyada kuchh aur maujood raha ho, halanke aap ke nau (9) ghar they."
"2509","ham ne Ibrahim Nakhai (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ke yahan qarz mein rahan aur zaamin ka zikr kya to unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Aswad ne bayan kya aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Yahudi se ghalla khareedaa aik muqarrara muddat ke qarz par aur apni zirah uske yahan girwii rakhi thi."
"2510","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Kab-bin-Ashraf (yahoodii, Islam ka pakka dushman) ka kaam kon tamam karega ke usne Allah aur uske rasool ko bahut takleef de rakhi hai. Muhammad-bin-Musallema (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main (ye khidmat anjam doonga). chunanche wo uske paas gaey aur kaha ke aik ya 2 wasq ghalla qarz leney ke iraadey se aaya hun. Kab ne kaha lekin tumhen apni beeviyon ko mere yahan girwii rakhna hoga Muhammad-bin-Musallema aur uske sathiyon ne kaha ke ham apni beeviyon ko tumharey paas kis tarah girwii rakh saktey hain jabke tum sarey Arab mein khoobsurat ho. usne kaha ke phir apni aulad girwii rakh do. unhon-ne kaha ke ham apni aulad kis tarah rahan rakh saktey hain isi par unhein gali di jaya karegi ke aik 2 wasq ghalley ke liye rahan rakh diye gaey they, to hamarey liye badi sharm ki baat hogi. albatta ham apne hathiyar tumharey yahan rahan rakh saktey hain. Sufiyan ne kaha ke lafz ( لأمة ( se murad hathiyar hain. phir Muhammad-bin-Musalema (Raziallahu anhu) us se dobara milney ka wada karke (chaley aaey aur raat ko iske yahan pahunch kar) usey qatl kar diya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di."
"2511","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya girwii janwar par uska kharch nikalney ke liye sawari ki jaey, doodh wala janwar girwii ho to uska doodh piyaa jaey."
"2512","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, girwii janwar par uske kharch ke badal sawari ki jaey. isi tarah doodh waley janwar ka jab wo girwii ho to kharch ke badal uska doodh piyaa jaey aur jo koi sawari karey ya doodh piey wahi uska kharch uthaaey."
"2513","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh muddat thehra kar aik Yahudi se ghalla khareedaa aur apni zirah uske paas girwii rakhii."
"2514","maine Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein (2 aurton ke muqaddime mein) likha to uske jawab mein unhon-ne tahreer farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya tha ke (agar muddaii gawah na pesh kar sakey) to mudduaa alaih se qism li jaeygi."
"2515","jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar us niyat se jhooti qism khaaey ke is tarah doosrey ke maal par apni milkiyat jamaaey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga. us irshad ki tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne (sura aale-Imraan mein) ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا‏ ( ''wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi poojii khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak unhon-ne tilawat ki. abu-Waaeil ne kaha iske baad asha's-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey ghar tashrif laey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman (abu-Masood (rz)) ne tum se kon si hadis bayan ki hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne uper wali hadis unke samney pesh kar di. is par unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sach bayan kya hai. mera aik (yahoodii) shakhs se kuwein ke mamley mein jhagdaa hua tha. ham apna jhagdaa lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna doosrey fareeq se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya phir ye to qism kha lega aur (jhoot bolney par) usey kuchh parwah na hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar kisi ka maal hadap karne ke liye jhooti qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par bahut hi zyada ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki. iske baad unhon-ne wahi aayat padhi ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا‏ ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey thodi poojii khareedtey hain''. aakhir tak."